pdf_words.txt — vendored word list for AnchorCore's PDF split-word catcher.

Source: wordfreq 3.1.1 (https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq), file
wordfreq/data/large_en.msgpack.gz, format "cB" v1 (frequency buckets).
Copyright 2022 Robyn Speer. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Derivation: first 30,000 words in bucket (frequency) order, filtered to
^[a-z]{2,}$ (lowercase ASCII alpha, length >= 2), deduplicated, sorted.
29,013 words (two source entries, `continental` and `acme`, removed:
client-associated names — detector calibration re-proven after removal).
Regenerate with the msgpack decode documented in the extract.rs split-word
catcher (buckets d[1..] concatenated in order), then delete those two lines.

Only membership is queried (fragment/join checks); frequencies are not used.
